OL,3,CWales win two bronze medals at
OL,4,CCommonwealth after dramatic night in
OL,5,Cthe pool
OL,7,FWales gain two bronze medals in the
OL,8,FCommonwealth Games after para-swimmer
OL,9,FRhys Darbey and the mixed freestyle
OL,10,Frelay team succeed on Saturday night
OL,11,F(25 July).
OL,13,FDarbey, 19 and from Deeside, initially
OL,14,Fmissed out on a podium finish in the
OL,15,Fmen's S14 200m freestyle final, after
OL,16,Fbeing narrowly beaten by his team-mate
OL,17,FDylan Broom.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/3
