OL,3,CWales win two bronze medals at
OL,4,CCommonwealth after dramatic night in
OL,5,Cthe pool
OL,7,FBut in a dramatic turn of events,
OL,8,FBroom was disqualified for "initiating
OL,9,Fa start early", raising Darbey to
OL,10,Fthird place.
OL,12,FFurther success for Team Wales was
OL,13,Fwith the 4x100 mixed freestyle relay
OL,14,Fteam, who also take home bronze behind
OL,15,FEngland and Australia.
OL,17,FMatt Richards, Dan Jones, Bex Sutton
OL,18,Fand Theodora Taylor also achieved the
OL,19,Fthird Commonwealth relay medal in the
OL,20,Fcountry's history.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/3
