OL,3,CWales win two bronze medals at
OL,4,CCommonwealth after dramatic night in
OL,5,Cthe pool
OL,7,FDarbey and the relay team follow Welsh
OL,8,Fpara-swimmer Ela Letton-Jones who won
OL,9,Fsilver during her Commonwealth debut
OL,10,Fon the opening night.
OL,12,FTeam Wales' medal tally is currently
OL,13,Fstanding at three.
